Z||000016||theogre||01-14-2001||04:29 PM||||take both vac lines off the canister and plug them. If the problem is vac related this will stop it.<P>Also This may only happen if the tank is real full. Once the level drops it may stop untill you fill it again.<P>You need to make sure it's stopped. It likely won't explode but it won't take much for it to light the car up like a hybachi.||||reg||1
